{"kind":"stack","id":"s1","title":"Sound and vibrations: volume and strength","theme":{"background":"#fff8e7","foreground":"#222222","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"wave"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Vibration"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A quick back-and-forth movement. Vibrations make sound."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Volume"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"How loud a sound is. Louder sounds have bigger vibrations."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"When a drum is hit harder, what happens to its vibrations?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"They get bigger","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"They get slower and smaller","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"They stop completely","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"Which sound is louder?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"A sound made by a big, hard pluck on a guitar string","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"A sound made by a gentle pluck on a guitar string","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Both sound the same","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"bell"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Ana is making a sound with a tuning fork. Should she strike it gently or hard to make it louder?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Strike it hard","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Strike it gently","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"Ana strikes hard. The fork vibrates widely and the sound is loud. Her friends cheer."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Ana strikes gently. The fork vibrates only a little and the sound is quiet. She tries again."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"A louder sound always comes from vibrations that are what?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"Smaller","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"Bigger","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"Slower","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-h","content":"Well done! You finished the sound and vibration quiz."},{"type":"text","id":"c9-m","content":"Remember: bigger vibrations make louder sounds. Keep exploring how sound works."}],"actions":[]}}
